[00:00.00]1. Hand in hand with our dear Father,
[00:07.15]We would humbly walk with him each day.
[00:14.31]Oh, how undeserved his kindness
[00:21.46]That he grants to those who seek his way!
[00:28.62]By his love God made provision;
[00:35.77]We may freely take his hand.
[00:42.93]So we make our dedication;
[00:50.08]With Jehovah we take our stand.
[00:57.24]2. In this day of Satan’s anger,
[01:04.39]As the end is drawing ever near,
[01:11.55]We are faced with opposition
[01:18.70]That could make us turn away in fear.
[01:25.86]But Jehovah gives protection;
[01:33.02]Close to him we want to stay,
[01:40.17]That we might forever serve him.
[01:47.33]Love him loyally, never stray.
[01:54.48]3. Help for us God has provided
[02:01.64]Through his spirit and his written Word,
[02:08.79]Through the Christian congregation,
[02:15.95]Through assurance that our prayer is heard.
[02:23.10]As we’re walking with Jehovah,
[02:30.26]He will help us do what’s right.
[02:37.41]He will help us to be loyal
[02:44.57]And walk modestly in his sight.